{"game": "terminull-brigade", "language": "english", "appid": 3104410, "month": "2026-02", "window": 1, "start_date": 1769904000, "end_date": 1772323199, "month_true_total": 16, "quota": 16, "returned": 16, "pulled_at": "2026-09-03 02:32:32 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "219464772", "author": {"steamid": "76561197993448338", "personaname": "kaldrenon", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/kaldrenon/", "num_games_owned": 1917, "num_reviews": 93, "playtime_forever": 6130, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 6130, "last_played": 1772302393, "avatar": "896d5be601416ff22522da5f07c4837956eb1ba8"}, "language": "english", "review": "I loved Terminull Brigade S0 and S1. Really fun roguelite, run-based third-person shooter with enjoyable characters and interesting mechanics. Played a ton of both seasons.\n\nIn S2, they replaced the run-based format with a build-based format where you play too-short levels with a fixed build to farm gear. The whole gameplay loop that made the game fun for me is gone - it's not the same game any more. I held out for S3, hoping they'd learn from their mistake and give us the game back, but S3 is out now and they have kept the build-based format. I simply have no interest in playing it the way it is today.\n\nIf they fix their mistakes I'll happily come back, but until then this seems like a game that the devs ruined on purpose.", "timestamp_created": 1772302656, "timestamp_updated": 1772302656, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1753830060", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "219394045", "author": {"steamid": "76561199573763082", "personaname": "vanishkens", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/vanishkens/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 473, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 473, "last_played": 1760830184, "avatar": "a1d9fccdd3c9402190f5e80c69b8e617cb2e3f37"}, "language": "english", "review": "It got repetitive way too quickly, kept stuttering and the AI slop just makes this game basically unplayable. It was so fun at first but I dropped it within like a week.", "timestamp_created": 1772238862, "timestamp_updated": 1772238862, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 6, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.547619044780731201", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1753830060", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 29, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "219364279", "author": {"steamid": "76561199212776621", "personaname": "FreyaDeandra", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/FreyaDeandra/", "num_games_owned": 37, "num_reviews": 36, "playtime_forever": 1950, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1950, "last_played": 1772214259, "avatar": "cc2ae68a84751073dbb619839368a8421ed9a826"}, "language": "english", "review": "GAME  IS  BAD  ,  LAGGING  PERIODICALLY IN SAME INTERVAL  LIKE  COUNTING  DAMAGE OR  .....", "timestamp_created": 1772214318, "timestamp_updated": 1772214318, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.455719888210296631", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1753830060", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "219149220", "author": {"steamid": "76561199070934464", "personaname": "maklabajsz", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199070934464/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 1063, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1063, "last_played": 1771944536, "avatar": "ffd461f688c1e0d19b2bb7a93bee6aa5da4ddd62"}, "language": "english", "review": "Not a bad game but you can get bored quickly because you have to do the same thing all the time. And the stuttering is disgusting. I tried to play for a while but there are no other players, it's a dead game. It was good for discord orbs.", "timestamp_created": 1771968403, "timestamp_updated": 1771968403, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.510729610919952393", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1753830060", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "218872775", "author": {"steamid": "76561199057573639", "personaname": "phew", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/morebassencore/", "num_games_owned": 147, "num_reviews": 123, "playtime_forever": 17, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 17, "last_played": 1765146711, "avatar": "25f14634c4b573151e7debc8340abfdaff1c2ad2"}, "language": "english", "review": "krzys koza z nosa", "timestamp_created": 1771688715, "timestamp_updated": 1771688715, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.510729610919952393", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1753830060", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "218533193", "author": {"steamid": "76561198853961882", "personaname": "Infected", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198853961882/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 429, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 429, "last_played": 1771331384, "avatar": "